      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA LET LOOSE (3) looks close to another win after hitting the frame in a 2 length second (22.13) in a Grade 6 at this track. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. One of the leading chances. TECHNO MISSILE (1) stalked the pace when winning a maiden two back then finished second last start and beaten 2.25 lengths at Capalaba over 366m (20.00). Maiden this journey but has some solid runs behind him. Rates a leading chance again. ONLY A DREAMER (2) was below best last time when fourth but prior to that was a Maiden winner in quick time at Dubbo. Safe beginner and drawn well close to the inside. Has the ability and expected to do much better. HILLTOP SMILE (6) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
